# data/raw holds the publishers' releases and is tracked: the archive carries its
# own sources so it can be regenerated and fully verified from a clone alone.
#
# Two exceptions, and only because GitHub refuses a file over 100 MB. Both are
# public downloads needing no registration, both have their URL and SHA-256 in the
# catalog, and `python3 scripts/fetch_raw.py` retrieves and checks them.
data/raw/aoi-2019-2020.sav
data/raw/aoi-2024-2025.sav

